<title>SPAIN: Pryca says 10-mth gross sales down 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Pryca says 10-mth gross sales down 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket chain Pryca said on Monday that gross group sales in the first ten months of the year fell 0.6 percent year-on-year to 470.48 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>In October alone gross sales totalled 46.80 billion pesetas, the firm said.</p>
<p>The company provided no further details.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
